        "detailed_description": "<h1>Player Notes</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong>: The game focuses on <strong>idle card collection</strong>. A traditional card battle system is <strong>not currently planned</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Window Control</strong>: The game window can be moved by <strong>right-clicking and dragging</strong> with the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/extras/236c69de0c61d737aae5ae252ac04d95.poster.avif?t=1757335113\" width=320 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/extras/236c69de0c61d737aae5ae252ac04d95.webm?t=1757335113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/extras/236c69de0c61d737aae5ae252ac04d95.mp4?t=1757335113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Cards &amp; Animations</strong>: Some <strong>gold cards and related animations</strong> are <strong>not yet fully implemented</strong>. These will be gradually added in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/extras/283b89afc1f8cde6fb3bedc8d201a436.poster.avif?t=1757335113\" width=180 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/extras/283b89afc1f8cde6fb3bedc8d201a436.webm?t=1757335113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/extras/283b89afc1f8cde6fb3bedc8d201a436.mp4?t=1757335113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/extras/d60c6be532f1d7a074ef8b29a6ac86e5.poster.avif?t=1757335113\" width=250 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/extras/d60c6be532f1d7a074ef8b29a6ac86e5.webm?t=1757335113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/extras/d60c6be532f1d7a074ef8b29a6ac86e5.mp4?t=1757335113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access Status</strong>: This is an <strong>Early Access build</strong>, meaning some features, visuals, and optimizations are still in development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the scene, a drop check is performed every 5 minutes. Of course, you can also reduce the cooldown by using items or clicking with the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access version includes 220 collectible cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the scene, a drop check is performed every 2.5 minutes. Of course, you can also reduce the cooldown by using items or clicking with the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card rarity drop rates are as follows: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common 60%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare 25%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic 12.5%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary 2%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Eternal 0.5%.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Idle Card Collection Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong><br>In this idle card game, you can expand your collection and grow your fortune without staring at the screen for hours.<br>Through simple idle mechanics and strategic decisions, you can automatically acquire cards, complete tasks, and build your very own card gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Collection</strong>: Earn coins and resources even while offline—effortless and beginner‑friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Trading</strong>: Sell your extra cards on the market, track price fluctuations, and make a profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pricing System</strong>: Market prices change over time—buy low, sell high, and maximize the value of your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Exploration</strong>: Unlock new areas and obtain rare cards through exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Album &amp; Achievements</strong>: Complete card sets to unlock achievement and special rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Is This Game For?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy collecting, trading, and idle gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual players looking for an easy‑to‑pick‑up game with long‑term growth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your journey to build the ultimate card collection and watch your wealth grow!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Idle Card Collection Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong><br>In this idle card game, you can expand your collection and grow your fortune without staring at the screen for hours.<br>Through simple idle mechanics and strategic decisions, you can automatically acquire cards, complete tasks, and build your very own card gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Collection</strong>: Earn coins and resources even while offline—effortless and beginner‑friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Trading</strong>: Sell your extra cards on the market, track price fluctuations, and make a profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pricing System</strong>: Market prices change over time—buy low, sell high, and maximize the value of your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Exploration</strong>: Unlock new areas and obtain rare cards through exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Album &amp; Achievements</strong>: Complete card sets to unlock achievement and special rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Is This Game For?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy collecting, trading, and idle gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual players looking for an easy‑to‑pick‑up game with long‑term growth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your journey to build the ultimate card collection and watch your wealth grow!</p>",
        "short_description": "Collect cards while AFK at work, study, or play; sell extra cards, and easily complete card book achievements.",
